description = [=["We did not arrive to negotiate or share resources. We came to rule."
The Vael'Thor are an ancient, bio-mechanical species whose homeworld was rendered uninhabitable eons ago through overpopulation and total warfare. Under the rule of the Supreme Archon, their society transformed into an absolute totalitarian empire.
Their core nature is driven by ruthless conquest: foreign worlds are stripped for raw materials, and foreign species are viewed as either slave labor or obstacles to be eliminated. Unlike the industrial pragmatism of the Trans-Gov Marines (TSA) or the organic mutations of the Kharaa, the Vael'Thor utilize antimatter, plasma systems, energy shielding, and psionic tech.

License: This mod is free to use for all real free to play servers without any custom content to buy for real money.]=]
